      "slug": "spine-increase-g72",
      "term": "Spine increase",
      "definition": "Two dc worked into the same centre stitch to add width at the midpoint of the shawl. Placed on every row to keep the triangle growing symmetrically."
    },
    {
      "slug": "edge-increase-g72",
      "term": "Edge increase",
      "definition": "Two dc worked into the first and last stitches of the row. Combined with the spine increase, edge increases create the classic triangle shape."
    }
